  "purpose": "Pinned, licence-checked weights for the optional character identity tier. The Klein multi-reference path remains the default; this lock only feeds workflows/character_identity_pulid.api.json when a user opts into it. Base image/video weights stay in colab/models.lock.json and are not duplicated here.",
